# Regenerated by `next dev` on every run. Deliberately not committed: this
# project is Claude-only and its harness contract lives in CLAUDE.md, so a
# second agent-instruction file at the root would be a competing source of
# truth. Ignoring it lets the framework recreate it without dirtying the tree.
AGENTS.md
